Since $z = f$, we can write $s + o + z + z + s = 10$, which simplifies to $2s + o + 2z = 10$.
We also have $o = 2s$ and $s = 2z$. We can express $z$ in terms of $s$: $z = \frac{s}{2}$.
Now, substitute $o = 2s$ and $z = \frac{s}{2}$ into the equation $2s + o + 2z = 10$:
$2s + 2s + 2(\frac{s}{2}) = 10$
$2s + 2s + s = 10$
$5s = 10$
$s = 2$
