Let $t$ be the time it takes for 4 turtles to travel the distance.
The distance is $4 \times \frac{1}{2} v \times t = 2v t$.
So $2v t = 54v$.
Dividing by $2v$, we get $t = \frac{54v}{2v} = 27$.
Therefore, it takes 27 hours for 4 turtles to travel across the highway.

